      "object": "First, the design of the current study was determined by a parent study which is focused on physical fitness and mental health among Kathak dancers. Thus, the inclusion and exclusion criteria for both Kathak dancers and non-dancers, including gender, were already established. This narrower focus reduces the generalizability of findings; however, they also provide an important insight into a group of dancers that are not usually assessed. Second, the present study utilized two well-established questionnaires, but did not include a clinical assessment of ED attitudes, limiting our understanding of possible clinical impairment amongst Kathak dancers. Last, all data were self-reported; future research should aim to conduct clinical interviews and/or gather objective data to further elucidate our understanding of ED behaviors amongst this group."
